ASK: "Install changes in Goose? (y/N)"
IF yes:
  IF DETECTED_MODE == "mas": bash {workspace}/install.sh
  IF DETECTED_MODE != "mas": ""
  📦 step 8 PUSH_IMPROVEMENTS is executed"
  → "✅ MAS updated — immediately active"

